===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun}}

# One who disclaims, disowns, or renounces.
# A public [[disavowal]], as of responsibility, pretensions, claims, opinions, and the like.
# {{lb|en|legal}} A denial, disavowal, or renunciation, as of a title, claim, interest, estate, or trust; relinquishment or waiver of an interest or estate.

